  "description": "When a person dies, the grim reaper comes and calls their name three times. When the grim reaper and the deceased arrive at Samdo Stream, there is a very large tree called Uiryeongsu with a small restaurant called 'Salasengjeon'. This is the story of the food the deceased wanted to eat the most in life and the grim reaper 'Sa' who guides them there.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=832575), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11640268)",
